flowchart LR
    User[Admin / Manager / Agent] --> HTTPS[HTTPS<br/>99-79-66-16.sslip.io]
    HTTPS --> Caddy[Caddy reverse proxy<br/>ports 80 and 443]
    Caddy --> EC2[Amazon EC2 t3.micro<br/>ca-central-1]
    EC2 --> Docker[Docker runtime]
    Docker --> App[FastAPI container<br/>NexusLead AI]
    Docker --> DB[(PostgreSQL container<br/>nexuslead-postgres volume)]
    Docker --> Uploads[(Uploads volume)]
    Docker --> Backups[(Daily pg_dump backups<br/>7-day retention)]
    App --> Logs[CloudWatch logs<br/>/nexuslead-ai/ec2]

    GitHub[GitHub repository] --> Actions[GitHub Actions CI/CD]
    Actions --> OIDC[GitHub OIDC<br/>least-privilege IAM role]
    OIDC --> ECR[Amazon ECR<br/>nexuslead-ai]
    OIDC --> SSM[AWS Systems Manager<br/>RunShellScript deploy]
    SSM --> EC2
    ECR --> App

    EC2 --> Health[/health and /metrics/]
